      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "OUR ASTUTE LASS (9) returns for her second campaign with an 800m trial placing. Started hard in the market on debut with a battling fourth over 1100m at Armidale last April. Kicks off in a fairly strong contest and is expected to have strengthened over the break. PEREGRINA PEARL (5) resumes from a lengthy spell and is now in the Melissa Dennett yard. Snagged back from the wide gate on debut with a dismal tenth over 1000m at Eagle Farm last January. Fitted with the good 800m trial placing and has a host of gear changes. Must be included at this level. A LITTLE BIT DUSTY (6) Shamus Award colt from Dame Gina on debut for the Brett & Georgie Cavanough yard. Looked sharp with a recent trial win over 1000m at Muswellbrook. Everything points to a positive debut. MY DIAMOND LOVE (4) Al Maher mare from Ma Ma I Love You on debut for the Scott Singleton camp. Primed with the two trials and gets her chance from the inside gate.",
